{"title":"2014 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/b/80bdf16a63fd5c8c8170ed00016aaff3badb5e58.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10101$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"44\" height=\"13\" /> is equal to\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/1/f11c0d6bc950626433e2ae26d543f264ed69d7ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }1000+100+1\\qquad\\textbf{(B) }1000+10+1\\qquad\\textbf{(C) }10~000+10+1\\qquad\\textbf{(D) }10~000+100+1\\qquad\\textbf{(E) }100~000+100+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"930\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Splitting the number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/b/80bdf16a63fd5c8c8170ed00016aaff3badb5e58.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10101$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"44\" height=\"13\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/d/51deda7099bda43f306a2e651c7612ef33e0195c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(D) } 10~000 + 100 + 1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"181\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td s